# Web client

Follow [design.md](../../design.md) for Studio tokens, primitives, and presentation. Its interaction and specimen references are conditional on the affected behavior.

- Use functional React and plain CSS with Vite.
- Persisted project state belongs to the application service; selection, panels, viewport, and unsaved edits stay local.
- Validate external responses with shared core schemas. Reuse connection/request hooks and discard obsolete responses without losing newer drafts.
- Use real thumbnails and recorded crops. For changed UI, inspect the affected screen in a desktop browser and exercise relevant keyboard, loading, and reduced-motion paths.
